OL,3,GNEWSATeams working to prevent fire at
OL,4,Abeauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FRangers working to protect Dartmoor all
OL,7,Fyear round are reminding people that
OL,8,Ffires are not allowed at the national
OL,9,Fpark at any time and can prove
OL,10,Fdisastrous.
OL,12,FDeputy head ranger Ella Briens said: "A
OL,13,Fwildfire at this time of year would be
OL,14,Fso impactful and the fire itself could
OL,15,Factually go underground and continue
OL,16,Fburning for days, weeks, even months."
OL,18,FShe said the team had to move people in
OL,19,Ftents in areas closed to camping and
OL,20,Ffound the remains of barbecues which
OL,21,Fhad scorched the parched grass around
OL,22,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
