OL,3,GNEWSATeams working to prevent fire at
OL,4,Abeauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FDartmoor marshals had patrolled the
OL,7,Fbeauty spot and advised people about
OL,8,Ffire risks. Firebreaks have also been
OL,9,Ferected to help stop fires spreading.
